[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_xy6if")
icon = ExtResource("1_xvlk8")
label = "Bridge"
tooltip = "An intuitive brush for creating bridges between two points.

[b]Info[/b]:
The [EDITOR_KEYWORD]bridge_curve_falloff[/EDITOR_KEYWORD] can be set via the [EDITOR_ACCENT]Ease Value[/EDITOR_ACCENT] attribute. For further reference see the ease value cheatsheet in the [u]documentation+[/u] folder.

Enabling [EDITOR_ACCENT]Curve3D Mode[/EDITOR_ACCENT] changes the bridge calculations to be point based, allowing for free form bridges."
attributes = SubResource("Resource_l6yvy")
